language sdl-mvp1-exercise version 0.1.

scenario SemanticOperatorAction.
condition SemanticOperatorActionReady.
condition SemanticOperatorActionContinue.
condition SemanticOperatorActionReject.
outcome SemanticOperatorActionCompleted.
outcome SemanticOperatorActionRejected.
step SemanticOperatorActionRoute.
step SemanticOperatorActionValidate.
step SemanticOperatorActionInject.
step SemanticOperatorActionReduce.
step SemanticOperatorActionFailure.
step SemanticOperatorActionSuccess.

SemanticOperatorAction illustrates OperateMachineInputs.
SemanticOperatorAction exercises AuthoritativeMachineState.
SemanticOperatorAction starts-when SemanticOperatorActionReady.
SemanticOperatorAction starts-at SemanticOperatorActionRoute.
SemanticOperatorActionReady describes "An authorized semantic operator action is requested via UI/tool public contract.".
SemanticOperatorActionContinue describes "The previous operation succeeded and the next step's declared contract preconditions remain true; exact predicates are an executable-language gap.".
SemanticOperatorActionReject describes "Validation, authority, applicability or operation failure prevents continuation; preserve prior valid state and report the specific reason.".
SemanticOperatorActionCompleted describes "The stated design path completed under its explicit obligations; this is not an observed test result.".
SemanticOperatorActionRejected describes "The path terminated without claiming the requested change succeeded; failures remain observable.".
SemanticOperatorAction preserves ServerBoundAuthority.
SemanticOperatorAction preserves DomainTruthOwned.
SemanticOperatorActionRoute calls RouteBrowserCommand within BuckingWeb.
SemanticOperatorActionRoute describes "Virtual palette goes to MachineService.".
SemanticOperatorActionRoute proceeds-to SemanticOperatorActionFailure when SemanticOperatorActionReject.
SemanticOperatorActionRoute proceeds-to SemanticOperatorActionValidate when SemanticOperatorActionContinue.
SemanticOperatorActionValidate calls ValidateMachineCommand within MachineService.
SemanticOperatorActionValidate describes "Server checks runtime capability, peer and scope.".
SemanticOperatorActionValidate proceeds-to SemanticOperatorActionFailure when SemanticOperatorActionReject.
SemanticOperatorActionValidate proceeds-to SemanticOperatorActionInject when SemanticOperatorActionContinue.
SemanticOperatorActionInject calls InjectSemanticOperatorInput within MachineService.
SemanticOperatorActionInject describes "Generate normalized injected event without fake P1000 bytes.".
SemanticOperatorActionInject proceeds-to SemanticOperatorActionFailure when SemanticOperatorActionReject.
SemanticOperatorActionInject proceeds-to SemanticOperatorActionReduce when SemanticOperatorActionContinue.
SemanticOperatorActionReduce calls ReduceMachineState within MachineService.
SemanticOperatorActionReduce describes "Serialize accepted state and correlated result.".
SemanticOperatorActionReduce proceeds-to SemanticOperatorActionFailure when SemanticOperatorActionReject.
SemanticOperatorActionReduce proceeds-to SemanticOperatorActionSuccess when SemanticOperatorActionContinue.
SemanticOperatorActionFailure finishes SemanticOperatorAction with SemanticOperatorActionRejected.
SemanticOperatorActionSuccess finishes SemanticOperatorAction with SemanticOperatorActionCompleted.
SemanticOperatorActionRoute emits MachineRequests through MachineServiceUpstream.
SemanticOperatorActionValidate receives MachineRequests through MachineServiceUpstream.
